description:
Travel through different seas, catch fish in a variety of magical places.

In our game, very many unique bodies of water.

Game features:

- more than 100 kinds of fish;
- a lot of unique water bodies;
- cool fishing gear;
- various tasks;
- aquariums where you can grow and sell fish.

No sooner has Noob escaped from prison than he finds himself behind bars again!

Each time the conditions of escape change.
The tasks have become even more difficult, and the tension is even higher.
Use your brain to the fullest!

Our hero is waiting for you! Help him out!

Game Features:
- 50 unique levels;
- Beautiful graphics;
- Nice sounds and music;
- Nubik Game;
- Puzzle Game;
- Continuation of the popular game.
